---
name: trace
type: registry:ui
title: Trace
description: Composable activity traces with status lines and expandable details.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
  - "@lucide/svelte"
registryDependencies:
  - collapsible
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/index.ts"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-collapsible-content.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-collapsible-content.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-collapsible-trigger.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-collapsible-trigger.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-collapsible.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-collapsible.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-description.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-description.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-icon.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-icon.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-line.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-line.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace-title.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace-title.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/trace/trace.types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/trace/trace.types.ts"
---

Compose an activity log with lines, decorative icons, titles, and optional descriptions. Set a line's `status` to `running`, `pending`, or `error`; omit it for a completed or neutral step. Use the collapsible parts to reveal supporting output. `Collapsible` supports bindable `open` and the underlying Bits UI props.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Trace from "~/components/trace";
</script>

<Trace.Root>
  <Trace.Line><Trace.Title>Read project configuration</Trace.Title></Trace.Line>
  <Trace.Collapsible open>
    <Trace.CollapsibleTrigger>
      <Trace.Line><Trace.Title>Ran node --version</Trace.Title></Trace.Line>
    </Trace.CollapsibleTrigger>
    <Trace.CollapsibleContent>v24.18.0</Trace.CollapsibleContent>
  </Trace.Collapsible>
</Trace.Root>
```
